    "sections": {
        "description": "Frosty Cake is a delightful, visually appealing, and multipurpose theme designed for bakeries, cake shops, pastry stores, dessert cafes, chocolatiers, confectioneries, custom cake designers, wedding cake services, birthday cake businesses, cupcake shops, dessert delivery services, and culinary entrepreneurs. Perfect for showcasing products such as cakes, cupcakes, pastries, desserts, chocolate treats, bakery items, cake galleries, and seasonal specials, this theme provides a professional platform to highlight your offerings. Featuring a clean, modern, responsive, and mobile-friendly design, it ensures a seamless browsing experience across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. Key sections include product showcases, banners with Call to Action (CTA) buttons, testimonial areas, team introductions, and gallery displays, allowing you to present your creations beautifully. With advanced customization options for layouts, colors, and typography, Frosty Cake allows you to reflect your brand identity effortlessly. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for online orders and payments, Contact Form 7 for customer inquiries, and YITH WooCommerce Wishlist for product saving, this theme combines style, functionality, and performance, making it ideal for bakeries and dessert businesses looking to engage customers and grow their online presence. Demo: https://preview.wpradiant.net/frosty-cake/"
    },
